+# Avirta Project
+
+## Installation
+
+### Prerequisites
+- Python 3.12.7
+- Conda package manager
+
+### Setup using conda
+
+1. Clone the repository:
+```bash
+git clone [repository_url]
+cd avirta
+```
+
+2. Run the setup script:
+```bash
+chmod +x setup.sh
+./setup.sh
+```
+
+3. Activate the environment:
+```bash
+source activate avirta
+```
+
+### Manual Setup
+
+1. Create and activate conda environment:
+```bash
+conda create -y -n avirta python=3.12.7
+source activate avirta
+```
+
+2. Install dependencies:
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+```
+
+## Development
 
+Refer to `docs/tasks.md` for a comprehensive list of development tasks and priorities.
+
+## License
+
+[License information]
